      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "✅实习：\n1️⃣实习项目中遇到的挑战是什么？\n-这个问题需要提前准备一下，往toC项目上去引导，面试官都喜欢toC项目（八股多）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/6842b90e000000000303cc67.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
